\begin{abstract}
Project Mnemosyne establishes a neuro-sovereign simulation architecture designed to eradicate
Alzheimer's and dementia by enforcing a triad of invariants across molecular, cellular, and
network substrates. This publication formalizes the White Sheet charter, the Codex Capsule,
the execution dynamics, and the stress-testing validation under maximum adversarial load.
