\section{Introduction}

Neurodegenerative diseases such as Alzheimer's and dementia emerge from multi-scale
pathological cascades involving amyloid-beta aggregation, tau misfolding, mitochondrial
collapse, microglial hyperactivation, and synaptic degradation. Project Mnemosyne constructs
a sovereign simulation engine in which these cascades cannot propagate.

The engine enforces three core invariants:
\begin{enumerate}
  \item proteostatic decay,
  \item bioenergetic stability,
  \item synaptic fidelity.
\end{enumerate}

Their joint satisfaction defines the Neuro-Sovereign Stability regime.

